{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_163_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_163","textTraditional":"一、十有四年。春王正月，季孫宿、叔老會晉士匄、齊人、宋人、衞人、鄭公孫囆、曹人、莒人、邾婁人、滕人、薛人、〈木巳〉人、小邾婁人會吳于向。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_163_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_163","textTraditional":"二、二月乙未朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_163_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_163","textTraditional":"三、夏四月，叔孫豹會晉荀偃、齊人、宋人、衞北宮結、鄭公孫囆、曹人、莒人、邾婁人、滕人、薛人、〈木巳〉人、小邾婁人伐秦。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_163_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_163","textTraditional":"四、己未，衞侯衎出奔齊。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_163_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_163","textTraditional":"五、莒人侵我東鄙。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_163_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_163","textTraditional":"六、秋，楚公子貞帥師伐吳。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_163_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_163","textTraditional":"七、冬，季孫宿會晉士匄、宋華閱、衞孫林父、鄭公孫囆、莒人、邾婁人于戚。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}